{
  "id": "196",
  "title": "How Bad is the Traffic in Beijing?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2016-12-14",
  "synopsis": "Little Wang asks his friend Little Zhang how bad the traffic in Beijing really is.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/294/f283bbb2df3600530bc44128f9750ac3e298aed5.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "北京有多堵？\n\n     小王问正在北京工作的小张：“你老说堵车，北京真的有那么堵吗？”\n     小张说：“这么跟你说吧。有一天，我下班回家，在车上坐了45分钟。后来，经理有事叫我回去一下，我下了车走了5分钟就到公司了。你说北京堵不堵？”",
    "traditional": "北京有多堵？\n\n     小王問正在北京工作的小張：“你老說堵車，北京真的有那麼堵嗎？”\n     小張說：“這麼跟你說吧。有一天，我下班回家，在車上坐了45分鐘。後來，經理有事叫我回去一下，我下了車走了5分鐘就到公司了。你說北京堵不堵？”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How Bad is the Traffic in Beijing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小王问正在北京工作的小张：",
      "traditional": "小王問正在北京工作的小張：",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng wèn zhèng zài běi jīng gōng zuò de xiǎo zhāng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "“你老说堵车，北京真的有那么堵吗？”",
      "traditional": "“你老說堵車，北京真的有那麼堵嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ lǎo shuō dǔ chē běi jīng zhēn de yǒu nà me dǔ ma",
      "english": "Little Wang asked Little Zhang, who is currently working in Beijing:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“You always complain about the traffic, is the traffic in Beijing really that bad?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小张说：“这么跟你说吧。有一天，我下班回家，在车上坐了45分钟。",
      "traditional": "小張說：“這麼跟你說吧。有一天，我下班回家，在車上坐了45分鐘。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng shuō zhè me gēn nǐ shuō ba yǒu yì tiān wǒ xià bān huí jiā zài chē shang zuò le 3 fēn zhōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "后来，经理有事叫我回去一下，我下了车走了5分钟就到公司了。",
      "traditional": "後來，經理有事叫我回去一下，我下了車走了5分鐘就到公司了。",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái jīng lǐ yǒu shì jiào wǒ huí qu yí xià wǒ xià le chē zǒu le 1 fēn zhōng jiù dào gōng sī le",
      "english": "Little Zhang said: “Let me put it like this. One day I left work to go home, and had been driving for 45 minutes.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "你说北京堵不堵？”",
      "traditional": "你說北京堵不堵？”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ shuō běi jīng dǔ bù dǔ",
      "english": "“Then my boss called and asked me to come back to the office. I got out of the car and walked back in 5 minutes.”"
    }
  ],
