    "sentence_translations": [
      "How Bad is the Traffic in Beijing?",
      "",
      "Little Wang asked Little Zhang, who is currently working in Beijing:",
      "“You always complain about the traffic, is the traffic in Beijing really that bad?”",
      "",
      "Little Zhang said: “Let me put it like this. One day I left work to go home, and had been driving for 45 minutes.”",
      "“Then my boss called and asked me to come back to the office. I got out of the car and walked back in 5 minutes.”",
      "“So do you think the traffic in Beijing is bad?”"
    ]
